Visual Prompt Studio Phase 1.1
Prompt: Create a sci-fi movie poster of two women in a futuristic video game with multiple geometric figures surrounding the outside of the women. Put emphasis on the negative tones of the figures and harsh lines of the women. Add a view of a dystopian city lit up in the background filled with heavy metallic buildings. Keep the women as the focal point of the poster by using tones of contrast within the clothes on the women. 
Vocabulary Breakdown: Lines: are used in an art piece to direct the focal point or message of the piece to the viewers. Sometimes these are used to define shape as well. Shape: An object or a form that can be geometric or organic. Texture: the illusion or physical feel of an object that can make the viewer reconsider preconceptions. Volume: The weight or space that something can make the viewer feel or physically occupy in the artwork. Contrast: the vast difference between objects or lines, allowing the viewer to often see the "black and white" in the piece.
Revised Prompt: Create a sci-fi movie poster of two women in a futuristic video game with multiple geometric figures surrounding the outside of the women. Put emphasis on the negative tones of the figures and harsh lines of the women. Add a view of a dystopian city lit up in the background filled with heavy metallic buildings. Keep the women as the focal point of the poster by using colorful tones of contrast within the clothes on the women and adding a sense of companionship between the two.
